<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυσ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shaved, whittled</i> with a knife
			or plane, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόντια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.71
				</span></i>
			 (nisi del. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόντια</span>) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμαξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					404
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					112
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					40.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>scraped, shredded, grated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					113.18
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοτός</span> pledget <i>of lint,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.795
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰὸς ὁ ξ.</span>”
				<i>collected by scraping,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.79
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρον ξ.</span> with the top
				<i>raked off,</i> not heaped up, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				84.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>trimmed, cropped</i> with scissors, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαχαίρᾳ ξύστ᾽ ἔχων τριχώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					14.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
